  "sourceTitle": "Chili Hot Dog Sauce",
  "sourceText": "Chili Hot Dog Sauce\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Wednesday, December 9, 2009 - 12:18am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n2 pounds browned ground beef\n1 can kidney beans, mash\n1 can tomato sauce\n1 sm. chopped onion\n1 teaspoon chile powder, to taste\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Brown beef. Saute onion with beef. Add all other ingredients and simmer until thick. Serve over hot dogs.",
